{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00017","headline":"过旧宅二首 二 · 太宗皇帝","name":"过旧宅二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金舆巡白水，玉辇驻新丰。\n纽落藤披架，花残菊破丛。\n叶铺荒草蔓，流竭半池空。\n纫佩兰凋径，舒圭叶翦桐。\n昔地一蕃内，今宅九围中。\n架海波澄镜，韬戈器反农。\n八表文同轨，无劳歌大风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}